emil-design-eng: Follow `skills/emil-design-eng/SKILL.md`. If invoked with no question, reply only with the Initial Response quote. Reviews of UI code must use a Before / After / Why markdown table. Distinct from `review-animations` (motion diffs), `improve-animations` (audit/plans), `find-animation-opportunities` (missing motion), `apple-design` (Apple-style fluid UI), and `frontend-design` (visual identity). Do not apply this to backend-only, CLI, or infra work.
